  "body": "## Hotfix v2.0.4\n\n### Fixed\n- **Clone glow artifact**: Removed unnecessary MeshRenderer/MeshFilter that rendered uninitialized geometry → caused yellow glow on remote player clone\n- **Rim light always-on**: AdaptiveRimLight now OFF by default, only activates during dash (was constantly emitting light)\n- **Sorting layer sync**: Now syncs via tk2dSprite renderer instead of bare MeshRenderer\n\n### Added\n- F10/F11 diagnostic logging to identify input system issues (Legacy vs New Input System)\n- One-time startup diagnostic in Update() to verify MonoBehaviour lifecycle\n\n**Download:** SilksongCoop_v2.0.4.zip — extract to game folder, overwrite existing files.\n\n**After launch:** Check BepInEx/LogOutput.log for [Coop] diagnostic messages about input systems."
